  "main_finding": "The first cross-domain validation did not show a statistically significant universal accuracy advantage for pulsatile or event-triggered regulation. Event-triggered microcirculation did reduce model activation and inference time while preserving accuracy close to static stacking. Dataset-specific model selection was strongest overall, indicating that future autonomic policies should be specialised by data family."
